          "name": "sthan_ip_geolocation",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:d2d97891866795fee648d02cc1dff5adb370f5527ae111af6a3190ab2e924339",
          "description": "Look up the approximate geographic location of an IPv4 or IPv6 address and the network behind it. Returns country, region, city, coordinates, postal code, timezone with the current local time, flag, currency and calling code, the network (asn, asName, isp, organization), isMobile/isProxy/isHosting flags, reverseDns and a 0-1 confidence score. precision says whether the answer reaches a city, a region or only a country; confidence is absent when the address is new (ask again in a few seconds) or when sources disagreed; an isHosting or isProxy address does not locate a person. ",
